g=A.uJ(195,"IoT & Hardware","BLB Librarian (Better Letter Book) is a pioneering EdTech and Hardware/IoT mobile ecosystem bridging tactile physical books with rich digital multimedia. Parents scan physical books via instant NFC/RFID tag scanning, manage multiple child profiles ('Little Ones'), and activate a secure Child Safety Kiosk Mode restricting access strictly to parent-assigned content. Features real-time media quota tracking, device licensing, and flexible in-app tiered billing (Free, Family, Premium).",f,"IoT & NFC / RFID Flagship","blb_librarian","BLB Librarian (Better Letter Book)","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.blb.librarian",A.b(["Engineered native NFC/RFID reader interfaces and protocol parsing for instant book tag resolution.","Implemented secure Kiosk / Safety Mode preventing unauthorized app escape during children's reading sessions.","Designed and architected the parental Little Ones multi-profile access delegation system.","Integrated in-app billing subscriptions and dynamic media storage quota calculations.","Crafted high-fidelity custom UI with interactive audio playback and smooth asset caching."],h),e,"IoT smart learning app connecting physical books via NFC/RFID with child safety kiosk mode.",g)
